A||||17||skitime||Who's going to the KSC POCI Spring Meet June 10th (Food&Cruise& Show) ||||1||
Z||000000||skitime||06-04-2001||09:15 PM||||We are planning to go on Sunday to the KSC POCI Spring Meet Show at Freysinger Pontiac-GMC in Mechanicsburg, PA. We have about 12 Fieros meeting for breakfast near exit 21 of the PA Turnpike at 7:00 AM.  After breakfast, we will be cruising for an hour to the show. We would welcome anyone who wants to join us for breakfast. Please email me if you can make it because we have reservations at the diner and I can send you more details. More the merrier.  I know this is not a big show but I think it would be cool if more Fieros showed up than any other Pontiacs.  <P> <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL><BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pictures-1_5.jpg">    <P><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 06-04-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||skitime||06-04-2001||09:20 PM||||Show details:The show will be held at Freysinger Pontiac in Mechanicsburg, PA (www.freysinger.com).  Registration starts at 8:00AM, judging starts at 12:00NOON, and awards will be around 3:00PM. <BR>For Fiero's there are two classes available:<BR>H for stock Fiero's and K for modified.<BR> <BR>If you want to preregister send an email to Jeffery Reich at jreich@Ajilon.com  and send the following information:<BR>- Name <BR>- Address<BR>- City/State/Zip<BR>- KSC Member?<BR>- Phone<BR>- Year<BR>- Make<BR>- Model<BR>- Body Style<BR>- Class<P><BR>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL><BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pictures-1_5.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 06-04-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||84Bill||06-05-2001||10:18 AM||||Sunday right?<BR>I'll be there. for breakfast, camera in hand. Hope to see all 12 Fieros there, that would be the most!<P>Oh my! Over 600 posts! Am I a Fiero maniac or what.<p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 06-05-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000003||skitime||06-05-2001||11:00 AM||||Yes Sunday.  Hopefully everyone shows up. It will be cool to cruise with that many Fieros. I emailed you details so hopefully you got it. So far we have:<P>skitime (88 GT)<BR>Veronica V6 GT (88 GT)<BR>Fleabitdog (88 GT)<BR>84Bill (84SE)<BR>Fierochic88 (88 GT)& another car +3 people<BR>Fierochic88s Dad - Jim<BR>Student101 (84 SE)<BR>BruceP (84 SE)<BR>Sombers88 SE<BR>Ditz88GT (88 GT)<BR>Ditz88GTs friend (87 GT)<P>Anyone else that wants to please let me know so I can make reservations for you.<P><BR><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 06-05-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000004||Ditz88GT||06-05-2001||12:43 PM||||I'll be there!  I'm really looking forward to this weekend, should be a great time.  I may also be bring a friend and his 87 GT.  It will be great to finally everyone.<P>~Ditz88GT <A HREF="http://go.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://go.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||14
Z||000005||skitime||06-05-2001||01:42 PM||||Ditz88GT I will email you details.  I thought I had last night but I might of had the wrong address.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Veronica's V6 GT||06-05-2001||10:31 PM||||I'm really looking forward to this gathering, seeing some old faces and meeting some new ones.  We're going to show everyone at this show how much pride we have in our cars with such a good turn out. <P>Veronica <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>88 GT<BR></UL><P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Vonnies.jpg"> ||||reg||1
