Z||000015||Brucepts||06-08-2001||11:35 PM||||Humm now let me get this straight . . . I'm getting up early on my day off to have breakfast with a bunch of Fiero owners that I've never met before (cept one or two)? Am I sane? This can't be normal? I do need to go to a "Fieroholics" meeting  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Good thing I only live 2 miles from Silk City Diner. Hey Skitime, since I have a white fiero and Veronica has a white fiero can I sit next to her at breakfast? hehehe Course her fiero looks way better than mine, you'all might make me park way in the back with my "Amish Ferrari" as they call it at work!! <P>------------------<BR>Advanced Dealer in the Great Material Continuum . . .<BR>Non Fiero Website: <A HREF="http://tractorsport.com" TARGET=_blank>http://tractorsport.com</A> <BR>You can't race a dyno . . .||||reg||7
Z||000016||skitime||06-09-2001||07:11 AM||||I am sure Veronica would be pleased to sit next to you at breakfast.  I love the Amish Ferrari line LOL.  Start planning to go to the GM Show at Carlisle in two more weeks.||||reg||1
Z||000017||Brucepts||06-10-2001||08:36 PM||||Hey just wanted to say I enjoyed meeting all the new people this morning at Breakfast, hope you all had a good day at the show. I sure wish I coulda made it. <P>I do have one complaint. I was the last Fiero out of the parking lot, but before I got out the cops showed up and wanted me to explain why I was doing burnouts in front of the Diner!! LOL  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Advanced Dealer in the Great Material Continuum . . .<BR>Non Fiero Website: <A HREF="http://tractorsport.com" TARGET=_blank>http://tractorsport.com</A> <BR>You can't race a dyno . . .||||reg||11
